Z||000012||PK||12-01-2001||09:35 AM||||Yep it was a real shock to hear of George's death.  He lived about 10 miles from me here in Oxford, UK.  He had been in the press a lot recently after a mad man broke into his house and stabbed him in the chest a few years back and recently with his lung cancer operations.  Aswell as the Beatles he was also heavily involved in the production/funding of british films (Monty Python etc).  <P>He will be missed by many here in the UK.<P>Cheers<P>PK<P><BR>||||reg||13
