Z||000020||Raydar||12-01-2001||06:12 PM||||    <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><B>Just so you know the first time I heard AC/DC it was on an 8 track.      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Okay. I still remember the first time I saw the Sgt Pepper album (there's that word) in the store. It was available in Stereo <I>and</I> Monaural versions. <P>And I will step up to defend yo_sweet.<BR>The Beatles were at the height of their popularity over 30 years ago. A lot of folks his age haven't ever paid attention to the Beatles, and haven't watched the way that music has evolved since. <P>I love music. All kinds of music. Even a lot of new stuff. But, with a few exceptions, I sure couldn't tell you who is playing a given tune. <P>[ignorant remark]I think a lot of the new alternative bands sound just like Pearl Jam[/ignorant remark]  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 12-01-2001).]||||reg||1
